---
// Servicios. SVGs inline simples (sin librerías).
---
<section id="servicios" class="bg-secondary py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold text-primary sm:text-4xl">Servicios</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-center text-text/70">
      Tratamientos kinesiológicos para tu recuperación y bienestar.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Kinesiología deportiva -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="13" cy="4" r="1.6" />
          <path d="M7 21l3-5 3 2 1 3M10 16l-1-4 4-2 3 3 2 1M5 11l3-1" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Kinesiología deportiva</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Prevención y recuperación de lesiones deportivas.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Rehabilitación post-quirúrgica -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="8" rx="4" transform="rotate(45 12 12)" />
          <path d="M12 9v6M9 12h6" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Rehabilitación post-quirúrgica</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Recuperación funcional luego de una cirugía.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Tratamiento de columna -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3v18" />
          <path d="M12 5h3M9 8h3M12 11h3M9 14h3M12 17h3" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Tratamiento de columna</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Dolores de espalda, cervicales y lumbares.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Drenaje linfático -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3c3 4 5 6.5 5 9.5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0C7 9.5 9 7 12 3z" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Drenaje linfático</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Reducción de edemas y mejora de la circulación.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Electroterapia -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Electroterapia</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Estimulación eléctrica para dolor e inflamación.</p>
      </article>

      <!-- Kinesiología respiratoria -->
      <article class="rounded-xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 3v8" />
          <path d="M12 7c0-1.5-1-2.5-2.5-2.5S7 5.5 7 8c0 3-3 3-3 7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0c0-3 2-3 2-7z" />
          <path d="M12 7c0-1.5 1-2.5 2.5-2.5S17 5.5 17 8c0 3 3 3 3 7a3 3 0 0 1-6 0c0-3-2-3-2-7z" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Kinesiología respiratoria</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text/70">Rehabilitación y fortalecimiento respiratorio.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
